  "description": "Your entry into adventure. Our new ADVENTR 4 is designed for anyone seeking extra suspension comfort without diving into extreme off-road terrain. Its specially engineered frame platform, with 120 mm travel in the front, 100 mm in the rear and an impressive total system weight allowance of 150 kg make this fully‑suspended e‑bike perfect for beginners, riders switching over, and everyday adventurers. The smoothly tuned Bosch Performance Line PX motor gives you natural, efficient support, while the 600 Wh battery provides ample range for long tours. Paired with the clear and intuitive Purion 200 display, it’s a worry‑free package ideal for those torn between a classic trekking bike and a comfortable adventure machine. Whether it’s health‑oriented training, a relaxed evening spin, or just craving more riding fun - the ADVENTR 4 makes your introduction to full-suspended e‑biking a true adventure.",
